[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; Editor-owned coastal Douglas fir inspired by the supplied field photograph.
; The trunk, bark marks, branch wood and foliage sprays are ordinary selectable
; nodes so the silhouette can be reshaped in the editor without generator code.

